jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. - The fourth season of the Mark Kellogg Show debuts at Kegler's Sports Bar and Grille on Tuesday, Nov. 10, from 6-7 p.m. ET. Kellogg will be back at Kegler's on Tuesday, Dec. 8, with his second show of the nonconference schedule.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/25/1920x1080_2.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/25/1920x1080_2.jpg"><media:title>Mark Kellogg Show 2026-27 dates and times for the six shows</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/25/1920x1080_2.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 11:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>9</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59590</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mawer Shines in Shutout Victory at Georgia Southern</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/25/mens-soccer-mawer-shines-in-shutout-victory-at-georgia-southern</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/25/mens-soccer-mawer-shines-in-shutout-victory-at-georgia-southern</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Toby Mawer kicks the ball for WVU Men's Soccer" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/25/MSOC_WVUvsUCF_Oct21_2026_TT_91_large.jpg" /><br /><br />STATESBORO, Ga. – The No. 25 West Virginia University men's soccer team picked up its first road win of the season, Sunday afternoon, with a 1-0 victory over Georgia Southern. The Mountaineers improve to 8-2-4 overall and 4-1-2 in the Sun Belt while the Eagles fall to 6-4-4 and 2-3-2 in conference play.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_p